.Dd October 18, 2026
.Dt OPERATOR 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm operator
.Nd operate and verify the pub4 repository
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm status
.Nm
.Cm measure
.Nm
.Cm gate
.Op Fl -scan-only
.Nm
.Cm test
.Op Ar path ...
.Nm
.Cm vps state
.Nm
.Cm vps deploy
.Ar app
.Op Fl -remote
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the repository-wide operator entry point at
.Pa MASTER/bin/operator .
It coordinates repository state, measurement, gates, tests and the approved
VPS operation interface.
.Pp
.Cm gate
runs the gate ladder and may repair files by default.
.Fl -scan-only
selects the read-only scan mode.
Do not use the default mode when only a
measurement is intended.
.Pp
.Cm status
reports repository state.
.Cm measure
reports current measurements and their limits.
.Cm test
selects the smallest complete proof available for the requested paths.
.Cm vps state
reads VPS state.
Deployment changes production and must follow the current
preflight and approval contract.
.Pp
For exact accepted arguments, consult the command's built-in usage and the
implementation in
.Pa MASTER/bin/operator .
Keep this page synchronized with those executable interfaces.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
MASTER/bin/operator status
MASTER/bin/operator measure
MASTER/bin/operator gate --scan-only
MASTER/bin/operator test
MASTER/bin/operator vps state
.Ed
.Sh SECURITY
The gate can write by default.
Use
.Fl -scan-only
for a read-only scan.
A successful local command does not prove that remote
services, browser rendering or production health are correct unless those
checks actually ran.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr master 1 ,
.Xr master-fix 1 ,
.Xr vps-deploy 8
